  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-datatransfer-interface\r\n\r\n> dataTransfer =​ new DataTransfer\\(\\)\r\n> Creates a new DataTransfer object with an empty drag data store\\.\r\n\r\nAt Chromium 61\r\n\r\n`let dt = new DataTransfer()`\r\n\r\nsets the value of `dt` to a `DataTransfer` instance. \r\n\r\nAt Firefox 57 \r\n\r\n`TypeError: Illegal constructor.`\r\n\r\nerror is thrown. Why?\r\n\r\n",
